12. **`_agent`** — [INTERNAL, hide=true] Entrypoint that runs inside an agent pane
13. **`_agent-leave`** — [INTERNAL, hide=true] Call `agent_leave` on daemon for dead agent
14. **`_mcp-proxy`** — [INTERNAL, hide=true] Long-lived stdio MCP server forwarding to panoptd
