16. **`_viewer`** — [INTERNAL, hide=true] Long-lived cockpit viewer pane
17. **`_close-gate`** — [INTERNAL, hide=true] Floating close-gate dialog
18. **`_delete-gate`** — [INTERNAL, hide=true] Floating delete-confirmation dialog

